# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of which git
# client (Windows git-bash with autocrlf=true, or WSL git with no
# autocrlf set) last checked them out - without this, the two clients
# fight over CRLF vs LF on every checkout, showing every touched file
# as "modified" with insertions == deletions == its total line count
# (pure line-ending noise, not real content changes).
* text=auto eol=lf
